WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.140
On <00:00:00.080>the <00:00:00.160>first <00:00:00.560>of <00:00:00.640>September,

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.400
Germany <00:00:01.840>invaded <00:00:02.340>Poland <00:00:02.660>from <00:00:03.060>the <00:00:03.200>west.

00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:06.260
Two <00:00:04.200>days <00:00:04.420>later, <00:00:05.140>Britain <00:00:05.360>and <00:00:05.600>France <00:00:05.860>declared

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:06.700
war.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:09.920
On <00:00:07.520>the <00:00:07.620>seventeenth, <00:00:08.600>the <00:00:08.760>Soviet <00:00:09.000>Union <00:00:09.460>invaded

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:10.680
from <00:00:10.320>the <00:00:10.460>east.

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:13.320
Within <00:00:11.440>five <00:00:11.860>weeks, <00:00:12.460>Poland <00:00:12.820>had <00:00:13.080>fallen.
